{"id":"n87072-1-10","stage":5,"title":"환호 · 欢呼","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87072-1-10-1","ko":"무슨 일이라도 있나? 사람들이 소리를 지르며 달려가네.","zh":"发生什么事了吗？大家都在尖叫着跑过去呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이라도","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리를","meaning":"声音，想法，消息","explanation":"소리：声音，想法，消息；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"4","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지르며","meaning":"喊叫","explanation":"지르다：喊叫；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"지르다","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62312","senseId":"1","lemma":"지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달려가네.","meaning":"跑去，奔赴","explanation":"달려가다：跑去，奔赴；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"달려가다","audio":"/audio/8e97da49c7b2bdbbe0ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62317","senseId":"1","lemma":"달려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，想法，消息","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"许多人共同的意见或传闻。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"987e83fdad67159d","term":"지르다","zh":"喊叫","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3","entryId":"62312","definition":"放开嗓音大叫。","pronunciation":["지르다"]},{"id":"8e97da49c7b2bdbb","term":"달려가다","zh":"跑去，奔赴","audio":"/audio/8e97da49c7b2bdbbe0ab.mp3","entryId":"62317","definition":"快速地跑着过去。","pronunciation":["달려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/65119b6cd710af04008e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87072-1-10-2","ko":"아마 연예인이라도 와서 환호를 하는 거겠지.","zh":"大概是有什么明星来了，大家才这么欢呼的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연예인이라도","meaning":"艺人","explanation":"연예인：艺人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"연예인","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14021","senseId":"1","lemma":"연예인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"환호를","meaning":"欢呼","explanation":"환호：欢呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"환호","audio":"/audio/bae2848340dde01b7802.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87072","senseId":"1","lemma":"환호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거겠지.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"c21f2e832c0791d6","term":"연예인","zh":"艺人","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3","entryId":"14021","definition":"把演技、唱歌或跳舞等演艺活动作为职业的人。","pronunciation":["여ː녜인"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"bae2848340dde01b","term":"환호","zh":"欢呼","audio":"/audio/bae2848340dde01b7802.mp3","entryId":"87072","definition":"因为高兴而大声喊。","pronunciation":["환호"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出，作出","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"露出某种表情或表现出某种态度等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b52e84c64e3021fe859.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.477,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87072","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大概是有什么明星来了，大家才这么欢呼的吧。","发生什么事了吗？大家都在尖叫着跑过去呢。","哥哥姐姐学习都很好，我们家怎么偏偏出了我这样的异类？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["发生什么事了吗？大家都在尖叫着跑过去呢。","哥哥姐姐学习都很好，我们家怎么偏偏出了我这样的异类？","大概是有什么明星来了，大家才这么欢呼的吧。"],"answer":2}]}
